# Paths excluded from Airflow DAG-file scanning at the dags root.
# Syntax: gitignore-style glob, matched against paths relative to this directory.
# plugins/ holds callback modules (mounted as /opt/airflow/plugins, ASK-Seoul#23)
# — importable, but never a DAG entry file.
plugins/

# Dev scope guard: Airflow may discover DAG files only under Weather or Traffic.
# This limits file scanning only; callback modules remain importable via plugins/.
/*
!/domains/
!/domains/weather/
!/domains/weather/**
!/domains/traffic/
!/domains/traffic/**
